NNAAMMEE
       iso_8859‐4  -  ISO/IEC  8859‐4 character set encoded in octal, decimal,
       and hexadecimal

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       The ISO/IEC 8859 standard includes  several  8‐bit  extensions  to  the
       ASCII  character  set  (also known as ISO/IEC 646‐IRV).  ISO/IEC 8859‐4
       encodes the characters used in Scandinavian and Baltic languages.

